{"id":"828ce1f1e146d1bc","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CGenerate.md","title":"CGenerate","display":"CGenerate","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"CGenerate","parameters":["g","t","n","m","E","a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"CGenerate"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>g</span><span>t</span><span>n</span><span>m</span><span>E</span><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：Curry 简单类型算法。有序参数：<code>g</code>、<code>t</code>、<code>n</code>、<code>m</code>、<code>E</code>、<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>确定的左到右约束生成；fresh 计数器严格串接，不搜索声明式推导。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ CGenerate g t n m E a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists z1712 (@ CGenerateProof g t n m E a z1712))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6256c42a05f07d73\" href=\"?note=6256c42a05f07d73\" title=\"ZFC_CGenerateProof\">CGenerateProof</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ CGenerate g t n m E a)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_CGenerateProof","status":"resolved","id":"6256c42a05f07d73","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_CGenerateProof|CGenerateProof]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":855,"backlinks":[{"id":"80fb57ef7d250c19","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CGenerate|CGenerate]]"},{"id":"e92b5c50303f0467","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[ZFC_CGenerate|CGenerate]]；[[ZFC_CSolve|CSolve]]；[[ZFC_CurryInput|CurryInput]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Single|Single]]；[[ZFC_Union2|Union2]]"},{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-496","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_CGenerate|CGenerate]]"},{"id":"f3184cdad9eb6fab","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CGenerate|CGenerate]]"}],"outgoing":["f625c6fc1945e22e","6256c42a05f07d73","593f9bdab4d60707"]}